config ZHIHE_A210_AON
	tristate "ZhiHe A210 AON protocol driver"
	depends on ZHIHE_A210_MBOX
	select AUXILIARY_BUS
	help
	  ZhiHe AON is a low-level system function which runs a dedicated
	  ZhiHe RISC-V E902 core to provide power, clock and resource management.

	  This driver manages the IPC interface between the host CPU and the
	  AON firmware running on the ZhiHe RISC-V E902 core.
